Statute and constitution text from the Wyoming Legislative Service Office (https://wyoleg.gov), text-only edition. Statute text cannot be copyrighted (Georgia v. Public.Resource.Org, 590 U.S. 255 (2020)); the annotated edition published under contract by LexisNexis is not used.

